    "description"     "[h1]Hello, Comrade![/h1]Are capitalist oil barons charging ruinous prices for fuel while your Distribution Offices happily swipe the Republic's treasury dry? Are sleepy border clerks exporting fresh Soviet steel at fire-sale kopek prices?

Rejoice! By decree of the [b]Supreme Soviet Price Control Bureau (Gosplan Division)[/b], every Distribution Office in your glorious Republic can now be issued strict ruble and dollar orders. If foreign markets try to gouge us or pay peanuts, our loyal drivers keep their engines parked until fair Socialist value returns! [i]No more funding bourgeois yachts out of the Five-Year Plan.[/i]

{EDITION_HEADER}
Source code & releases: [url=https://github.com/ZydraHydra/WorkersAndResources-Modding]ZydraHydra GitHub[/url]

[b]Alpha Field Dispatch:[/b] Treat this mod as an early [b]Alpha[/b] release. It has only been inspected on modest republics so far and needs far more field testing on massive late-game maps packed with Distribution Offices and rail hubs. Back up your glorious republic's saves first and report any saboteurs (bugs) or slowdowns on GitHub!

[h1]Wait - What is a DLL Mod? (Step-by-Step Setup)[/h1]Ordinary Steam Workshop mods only add buildings or vehicles. Because [b]TradePriceLimits[/b] adds an in-game [b]F8[/b] menu and custom border rules, it needs a [b]Mod Loader[/b] alongside the game. Simply clicking Play in Steam will [b]not[/b] load DLL mods on its own.

[b]Option A - Republic Mod Loader (Recommended, Easy Setup):[/b]
[list=1]
[*] Subscribe to this mod ([b]TradePriceLimits[/b]) - Workshop ID [i]{PUBLISHED_FILE_ID}[/i].
[*] Also subscribe to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3787969749]Republic Mod Loader (RML)[/url] ([url=https://github.com/Ultimate-Universe/WRSR-RepublicModLoader]RML GitHub[/url]).
[*] Open the RML folder on your PC:
[code]<Your Steam Library>\steamapps\workshop\content\784150\3787969749\[/code]
(Tip: this mod itself downloads to:)
[code]<Your Steam Library>\steamapps\workshop\content\784150\{PUBLISHED_FILE_ID}\[/code]
[*] Run [b]RepublicModLoader.exe[/b] (right-click -> create Desktop shortcut, or add it to Steam as a Non-Steam Game).
[*] In RML, make sure [b]TradePriceLimits[/b] is ticked/enabled, then click [b]Launch WRSR[/b].
[*] Load or start a savegame, then press [b]F8[/b] to summon the Price Control terminal!
[/list]
[b]Option B - TesmioLoader (Manual Copy-Paste):[/b]
Also compatible with [url=https://maxlegend.github.io/TesmioLoaderDocs/#/getting-started]TesmioLoader[/url]. Copy this mod's DLL from:
[code]<Your Steam Library>\steamapps\workshop\content\784150\{PUBLISHED_FILE_ID}\plugins\TradePriceLimits.dll[/code]
into your TesmioLoader plugins folder ([code]tesmioloader\build\plugins\[/code]), then launch via [i]tesmiolauncher.exe[/i] (or install via TLMM).

[h1]Operating the Price Control Terminal (In-Game)[/h1][list]
[*] Press [b]F8[/b] anytime in-game to open or close the window (or [b]Esc[/b] to close).
[*] [b]Fixed Mode (exact prices):[/b] Set a [b]Max Buy[/b] cap (blocks imports above your cap) or a [b]Min Sell[/b] floor (blocks exports below your floor). Set [b]0[/b] to leave a good unrestricted. Example: setting [i]Max Buy RUB = 45[/i] on Fuel keeps Soviet Customs fuel imports parked whenever fuel rises above 45 RUB/t.
[*] [b]Base % Mode (survives decades of inflation):[/b] Click [b]Fixed[/b] on a row to switch to [b]Base %[/b]. It snapshots today's market prices as 100%, so e.g. [i]115% Max Buy[/i] allows up to +15% above baseline and [i]85% Min Sell[/i] pauses exports if prices sink >15%.
[*] [b]Trash & Waste (negative prices):[/b] Customs pays you to import waste (shown as negative prices). Signed limits work directly - e.g. [i]Max Buy = -300[/i] means only import waste if the border pays at least 300/t.
[*] [b]Emergency Override:[/b] Citizens freezing and you need an urgent delivery at any cost? Uncheck [b]Enforce Limits[/b] at the top to suspend all rules in one click without wiping your table.
[/list]
[h1]Five-Year Plan Guarantees (Save-Safe & Performance)[/h1][list]
[*] [b]Convoys already rolling stay rolling:[/b] Blocking checks [b]new dispatches only[/b]. Trucks and trains already out on the road will finish their current trip safely.
[*] [b]100% Save-Safe & Rebindable Key:[/b] Rules are saved in a tiny [i]trade_price_limits.ini[/i] file inside your save folder (you can change [i]toggle_key=F8[/i] under [i][__settings][/i] to F1-F12, Home, Insert, etc.). Binary WRSR save files are never altered.
[*] [b]Separate RUB & USD limits:[/b] Police Soviet border posts (RUB) and Western customs (USD) independently.
[*] [b]60s Blocked Counter:[/b] Live readout shows how many border trips were vetoed over the last 60 seconds of active simulation time.
[/list]"
